  "remarks": "Pishgaman Tejarat Rafi Novin Co. is a private company with links to entities involved in Iran’s missile programme. Pishgaman Tejarat Rafi Novin Co. has procured significant amounts of ammonium perchlorate, a key propellant for solid-fuel missiles, from foreign suppliers for Iran’s missile programme. Pishgaman Tejarat Rafi Novin Co. is therefore involved in Iran’s missile programme.",
